# The golden data_dir fixture is a byte-for-byte recording of on-disk formats.
# Line-ending normalization would rewrite the WAL segment and break its
# per-record checksums, so the whole tree is exempt from any text conversion —
# `-text` is what makes that guarantee, and `binary` also keeps diffs quiet.
tests/fixtures/golden_data_dir/** -text -diff
# Except its README, which is prose and should behave like every other doc.
tests/fixtures/golden_data_dir/README.md text
